{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"じめじめ。\nじめじめきのこ。\n毎日雨だねーふぉーふぉー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の苔に芽が出てきて伸びてきた！\nさあ、この芽、どうなる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気になるところ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/19/5166431/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わちゃわちゃ。\n写りたがりのみんな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/19/5166431/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は朝日新聞の授業！\nディベートっておもしろい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/19/5166431/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オススメのマンガとかアニメ\nあったら教えてください(=ﾟωﾟ)ﾉ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/19/5166431/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"集めてるのが\nたいようのいえ、アオハライド。\n2巻で終わっちゃった、花と落雷。\nどっちも少女漫画です。\nアニメはあの花がいちばんすき。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/19/5166431/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テスト前日は寝ないで勉強する？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/19/5166431/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"計画しても失敗するので\n追い込む人間です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/19/5166431/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/19/5166431/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな服が好き？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/19/5166431/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上品で古風でカジュアルな\n変なのとかがすきー\nまとまってないね。\nでもすきなの着てるよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/19/5166431/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/19/5166431/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近はマキシワンピ着ないの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/19/5166431/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"移動時間が長かったりするときは\nマキシよく着るよー楽ちん！\n**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"豆乳とトマトジュース！\n野菜もいっぱい！\n夏バテしないように\nもりもりサラダ食べてます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんの夏バテ対策おせえて"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/19/5166431/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/19/5166431/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先輩とさゆ。\nみさ先輩今度ご飯食べたいー\nさゆ、今度遊びたいー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2人ともすき"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/19/5166431/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"げへへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はお仕事ー\nがんばろーう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}